      </li>
      <li class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-q">What is the superannuation guarantee rate in 2026?</h3>
        <p class="faq-a">The Superannuation Guarantee rate is 12% of ordinary time earnings for FY 2026-27, having increased from 11.5% on 1 July 2025. It is legislated to remain at 12% and there are no further increases currently scheduled.</p>
      </li>
